982
01:16:20,976 --> 01:16:29,356
 By the way this family of Bannu Abd-Ad-Dar(بنوعبدألدار), they also are the ones who hold the key to Al-Ka'aba(اَلْكَعْبَه).

983
01:16:30,287 --> 01:16:36,035
 And they still hold it, until this day, it's their descendents, they're the ones who hold the key to Al-Ka'aba(اَلْكَعْبَه).

984
01:16:37,312 --> 01:16:41,846
