1071
01:23:31,310 --> 01:23:33,559
So they went to Rasool Ullah and they said what happened?

1072
01:23:33,639 --> 01:23:35,821
Rasool Allah ﷺ said: Jibreel(جِبْرِيْل) came to me and said:

