However, Abdullah Bin Obaeye(عبدالله بن اُبَيئ), who was also an ally of Banu Nadhir(بنونضير),

1078
01:24:02,881 --> 01:24:04,148
he went to them and said:

1079
01:24:04,905 --> 01:24:08,986
If there's any fighting that's going to happen.

1080
01:24:09,361 --> 01:24:12,279
We will help you out, we will fight with you.

1081
01:24:13,350 --> 01:24:19,439
And if you are going to be driven out of your land, We're not going to allow that to happen, so stay put.

1082
01:24:21,513 --> 01:24:24,231
So Banu Nadhir(بنونضير) told Muhammadﷺ we're not gonna surrender.

1083
01:24:24,721 --> 01:24:28,671
Rasool Allah ﷺ laid siege to them and they were very wealthy and rich.

1084
01:24:29,106 --> 01:24:39,801
