They were counting on surviving a lot of siege because they have some good storage facilities, plus their farms outside.

1086
01:24:52,389 --> 01:24:57,638
 But what Rasool Allah ﷺ started doing is, cutting down their palm trees, they started screaming,

1087
01:24:57,678 --> 01:25:01,473
يا محمد كنت تنها عن الفساد في الأرض والآن تفسد في الأرض

1088
01:25:01,970 --> 01:25:08,560
O Muhammad(محمد), you are preventing people from causing corruption in land and then you do it, yourself.

1089
01:25:09,738 --> 01:25:16,551
